.TH INTRO 1
.SH NAME
intro \- the commands of SIEOS
.SH DESCRIPTION
Section 1 of the manual tells the commands a user types at the shell's
prompt. Some are built into the shell,
.BR sh (1);
the others are programs in
.BR /bin .
.B help
lists the built-in ones;
.B man \-k
.I word
finds a page by its summary.
.SS Files and directories (built into the shell)
.BR ls ,
.BR cd ,
.BR pwd ,
.BR cat ,
.BR echo ,
.BR cp ,
.BR mv ,
.BR ln ,
.BR rm ,
.BR mkdir ,
.BR rmdir ,
.BR touch ,
.BR chmod ,
.BR chown ,
.BR stat ,
.BR df ,
.BR sync ;
attributes:
.BR tag ,
.BR tags ,
.BR untag ,
.BR find ;
snapshots:
.BR snap .
.SS The system and you (built into the shell)
.BR ps ,
.BR kill ,
.BR mem ,
.BR uptime ,
.BR battery ,
.BR sleep ,
.BR clear ,
.BR whoami ,
.BR id ,
.BR groups ,
.BR logout ,
.BR exit ,
.BR help ;
.BR poweroff ,
.BR reboot ,
.B suspend
(root:
.BR poweroff (8)).
.SS Programs
.TP
accounts
.BR passwd (1),
.BR su (1)
.TP
the network
.BR fetch (1)
.RB ( curl ,
.BR wget ),
.BR ping (1),
.BR host (1)
.RB ( nslookup ),
.BR ifconfig (1),
.BR netstat (1),
.BR traceroute (1),
.BR nc (1),
.BR ssh (1),
.BR ssh\-keygen (1),
.BR mail (1),
.BR git (1)
.TP
devices
.BR wifi (1),
.BR bt (1),
.BR play (1)
.RB ( rec ,
.BR vol ),
.BR kblight (1),
.BR gpio (1),
.BR gfxhat (1),
.BR dmesg (1)
.TP
programming
.BR cc (1),
.BR make (1),
.BR python (1)
.TP
applications
.BR sia (1),
.BR scriptures (1),
.BR man (1),
.BR pkg (1)
.TP
tests
.BR hello (1),
.BR bench (1),
.BR fsloop (1),
.BR crash (1),
.BR racey (1),
.BR ktest (1)
.SH EXIT STATUS
A command ends with 0 when it did what was asked, another number when not;
the shell says which when it is not 0.
